@orders = http://localhost:8111
@products = http://localhost:8112

### happy path (customer-id travels as baggage)
POST {{orders}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
customer-id: c-42

{"productId": "p1", "quantity": 2}

### slow downstream (800 ms span in product-service)
POST {{orders}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
customer-id: c-42

{"productId": "slow", "quantity": 1}

### downstream 500 -> 502, error log + orders.failed
POST {{orders}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"productId": "broken", "quantity": 1}

### product-service directly
GET {{products}}/products/p2

### PromQL through the exposed Prometheus API
GET http://localhost:9090/api/v1/query?query=orders_created_total
